// Repo-root Go workspace — LOCAL multi-module dev convenience only (one `go build
// ./...` / one editor across every module). It is NOT the Docker build mechanism:
// each service container builds with GOWORK=off and resolves libs/go-pitwall via the
// `replace` directive in its own go.mod (architecture §"Build & Dev Mechanics" #4).
// Committed on purpose — see libs/go-pitwall/README.md.
go 1.26.4

use (
	./libs/go-pitwall
	./services/identity
	./services/leaderboard
	./services/timing
	./tests/conformance/go
)
